<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Foursome &amp; Then Some | a playable case study</title>
<!--
  FOURSOME & THEN SOME (built on the YOU+3 engine) : build-your-dream-foursome
  Single file, no backend, deterministic. Parody brands intentional (closed-link demo).

  ROB'S EDITING GUIDE
  1. To add a celebrity: copy any block in CELEBS, change the name, five scores
     (exactly one 5 or one 1 per celeb, that is their signature), wing, decade
     (PREWAR/MIDCENTURY/RETRO/Y2K/MODERN), pol/lm flags, card hook, and two "ev"
     event lines for the recap. That is the whole job.
  2. To tune tone: everything the recap can say lives in RECAP_LIB and each celeb's "ev".
  3. To tune matching feel: CONFIG knobs below, all commented.
  4. To rename the game: CONFIG.title.
  5. Uninvited guests live in CRASHERS (each has a "when" trigger). Course sightings live
     in CAMEOS (one per recap max, no repeats per session). Legend-tier gear jokes live
     in LEGEND_GEAR_BEATS, keyed by the option name in CATEGORIES.
  6. The icon guarantee: if no Icons-wing member shows in your first two plays
     of a session, the closest-scoring one crashes in. Logic is in resolveCrasher().
-->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,600;0,900;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --green:#123B23; --green2:#1F4E2C; --cream:#F6F1E5; --card:#FFFFFF;
  --gold:#C9A227; --ink:#1C2620; --sub:#5B6B60; --line:#E3DCC9; --red:#B33A2B;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
body{background:var(--green); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  min-height:100vh; display:flex; justify-content:center;}
#app{width:100%; max-width:480px; height:100vh; max-height:900px; overflow-y:auto; background:var(--cream); margin:0 auto;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
.screen{padding:22px 18px 36px; animation:fade .35s ease; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column;}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px);} to{opacity:1; transform:none;}}
.brand{font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.14em; font-size:12px; color:var(--green2); text-transform:uppercase;}
h1,h2,.fcard h3{font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;}
h1{font-size:44px; line-height:1.02; color:var(--green); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-.02em; margin:10px 0 6px;}
h2{font-size:24px; color:var(--green); font-weight:850; margin-bottom:6px; letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.sub{color:var(--sub); font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;}
.btn{display:block; width:100%; border:none; border-radius:14px; padding:16px;
  font-size:17px; font-weight:750; cursor:pointer; margin-top:14px;
  background:var(--green); color:var(--cream); transition:transform .06s ease;}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.985);}
.btn.gold{background:var(--gold); color:var(--green);}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--green2); border:2px solid var(--green2);}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.35; cursor:not-allowed;}
.meter{position:sticky; top:0; z-index:5; background:var(--cream); padding:10px 0 8px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);}
.meter .row{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;}
.meter b{font-size:26px; color:var(--green);}
.meter .tag{font-size:12px; color:var(--sub); font-weight:600;}
.cat{margin-top:18px;}
.cat h3{font-size:15px; color:var(--green2); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em;}
.cat .why{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--sub); margin:2px 0 8px;}
.opts{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px;}
.opt{border:2px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); border-radius:12px;
  padding:10px 10px 9px; cursor:pointer; text-align:left; font-size:14px; font-weight:650; color:var(--ink);
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:6px; transition:border-color .12s;}
.opt .price{font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:var(--green2); background:var(--cream);
  border-radius:8px; padding:3px 7px; white-space:nowrap;}
.opt.sel{border-color:var(--green); background:#EAF2EB;}
.opt.legend{border-color:var(--gold);}
.opt.legend .price{background:var(--gold); color:var(--green);}
.opt:disabled{opacity:.35; cursor:not-allowed;}
.legendtag{font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--gold); text-transform:uppercase; display:block;}
.q-progress{display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:18px;}
.q-progress i{flex:1; height:4px; border-radius:2px; background:var(--line);}
.q-progress i.on{background:var(--green);}
.scale{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:8px; margin:18px 0 10px;}
.scale button{border:2px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); border-radius:12px; padding:16px 0;
  font-size:18px; font-weight:800; color:var(--green2); cursor:pointer;}
.scale button:active{border-color:var(--green); background:#EAF2EB;}
.anchors{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px;}
.anchors span{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--sub); line-height:1.35; max-width:46%;}
.anchors span:last-child{text-align:right;}
.mc .opt{margin-bottom:8px; width:100%; padding:14px 12px;}
.mc{display:block;}
.reveal{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex:1; text-align:center;}
.spinner{width:54px; height:54px; border-radius:50%; border:5px solid var(--line); border-top-color:var(--green); animation:spin 1s linear infinite; margin-bottom:18px;}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.fcard{background:var(--card); border-radius:16px; padding:14px 14px 12px; margin-top:10px;
  border:2px solid var(--line); box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(18,59,35,.07); animation:fade .4s ease both;}
.fcard .wing{font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--cream);
  background:var(--green2); border-radius:7px; padding:3px 8px; display:inline-block;}
.fcard .wing.Presidents{background:var(--red);} .fcard .wing.Legends{background:var(--gold); color:var(--green);}
.fcard .wing.Athletes{background:#2B5D8C;} .fcard .wing.Entertainers{background:#6C4A8C;}
.fcard h3{font-size:21px; color:var(--green); margin:7px 0 3px; letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.fcard p{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--sub); line-height:1.4;}
.fcard.you{border-color:var(--green); background:#EAF2EB;}
.fcard.lebron{border-color:var(--gold); background:#FFF9E8; position:relative;}
.fcard.lebron::before{content:"UNINVITED"; position:absolute; top:-9px; right:12px; background:var(--gold);
  color:var(--green); font-size:10px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.1em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:6px;}
.recap{background:var(--card); border:2px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin-top:16px;}
.recap h4{font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--green2); margin-bottom:8px;}
.recap p{font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--ink) !important;}
.rating{font-size:34px; font-weight:900; color:var(--green); margin-top:10px;}
.coach{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--sub); margin-top:12px; text-align:center;}
.foot{font-size:11px; color:var(--sub); text-align:center; margin-top:22px; opacity:.8;}
.toast{position:fixed; bottom:24px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); background:var(--green);
  color:var(--cream); padding:10px 18px; border-radius:12px; font-size:14px; font-weight:650; opacity:0; transition:opacity .25s; pointer-events:none;}
.toast.show{opacity:1;}
</style>
</head>
