  {id:"EAG", type:"scale", q:"It is 11:15pm. A video titled FIX YOUR SLICE IN FOUR MINUTES appears in your feed. Odds you watch it?",
   lo:"Asleep. Slices heal on their own.", hi:"Watched it twice, then shadow-swung a spatula in the kitchen while everyone was asleep."},
  {id:"STY", type:"scale", q:"When was your first-tee outfit decided?",
