/* ============================== CAMEOS (sightings around the course) ==============================
   One per recap at most, session no-repeat. pol:true entries respect the politics gate. */
const CAMEOS=[
 {n:"Jake Hutt", line:"Jake Hutt was filming a swing tip on the range and diagnosed your grip from forty yards away, unprompted and correctly."},
 {n:"Paige Spiranac", line:"Paige Spiranac was shooting a course vlog on 12 and rated your group's pace of play a very fair B+."},
